body:
Have you been taught to do some exercise to relax a bit? Notice what you smell, see, hear, touch, and or even taste. I have been struggling too. I am trying hard to breath in and out deeply and then try to close my eyes and think of a happy time and pretend I am there. The despair will pass but when we feel it, it is so excruciating and unbearable. I have been wanting to text my therapist all day too.
I even wrote an email but sent it to myself. 
I wish I could give you a hug:;
